      "side": 1,
      "message": "Bikeshed alert!\nTest APIs seems wrong; CompOs isn\u0027t a test.\n\nuse_platform_apis, use_restricted_apis, ... ?\nAlso, s/use/enable/ ?\n\nAnother thought: any use of a config file at all implies platform code or test APIs. So if that\u0027s all you care about you don\u0027t need a flag in the config file; the fact there is a file at all is enough. But not every case where we use a config file will actually need raw BCC access.\n\nSo, enable_raw_DICE_access, or something like that?",
